assume that if \emph{M} is sampled from \emph{U}(\emph{P}) and \emph{C}
is the output of algorithm Enc given \emph{pk} and \emph{M} as inputs,
then the decryption device decrypts correctly with probability

signicantly more than 1\emph{/\textbar P\textbar{}}:
