scheme. Once these hint vectors are revealed, it becomes easy to
distinguish the left distribution from the uniform distribution: take
one of the vectors \emph{\textbf{x}}+ \emph{i}, get a challenge sample
\emph{\textbf{y} i, \textbf{y}⟩∈}T; if \emph{\textbf{y}} is a sample
from the left distribution, then the centered and compute
