(PSam\emph{i})0\emph{≤i≤t}. The parameters are almost identical to the
parameters in the Setup of the multi-user scheme of Section 4. A further
dierence, required for simulation purposes in the security proof, is
that \emph{σ′\textgreater{} σ}must be set\emph{Ω}(\emph{√mn} +
\emph{πq}).

